# Only rust/ goes into the build. Everything else stays out of the context.
*
!rust/Cargo.toml
!rust/Cargo.lock
!rust/rust-toolchain.toml
!rust/crates/
!rust/migrations/
!rust/frontend/
rust/frontend/node_modules/
rust/frontend/public/build/
rust/crates/**/target/
# Integration tests aren't built into the image; keeping them out means a test-only change
# rebuilds nothing (see docker/bin/source-revision).
rust/crates/*/tests/
